    "If the error repeats, or the operation lamp blinks, you should call the dealer. A single short error that went away by itself is often harmless." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gjentar feilen seg, eller blinker driftslampen, bør du ringe forhandleren. Én enkelt kort feil som har gått over av seg selv er ofte ufarlig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the error repeats, or the operation lamp blinks, you should call the dealer. A single short error that went away by itself is often harmless. %@" : {
