    "The Wi-Fi adapter had not reported in for over an hour when the status was fetched. Last contact: %@. The heat pump can still heat as normal, but we cannot see what it is doing." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wi-Fi-modulen hadde ikke rapportert inn på over en time da status ble hentet. Siste kontakt: %@. Varmepumpen kan fortsatt varme som normalt, men vi ser ikke hva den gjør."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Wi-Fi adapter had not reported in for over an hour when the status was fetched. The heat pump can still heat as normal, but we cannot see what it is doing." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
