    },
    "The Wi-Fi adapter itself says the connection to MELCloud is turned off (CONNECT = OFF). Then neither status nor changes from MELCloud get through, and the app can only read locally." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wi-Fi-modulen sier selv at forbindelsen til MELCloud er slått av (CONNECT = OFF). Da kommer verken status eller endringer fra MELCloud fram, og appen kan bare lese lokalt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Wi-Fi adapter on the home network reports error code %@. The code comes directly from the indoor unit and is not translated; MELCloud has not reported the error yet. %@" : {
