        }
      }
    },
    "This can be perfectly normal when it is very cold outdoors, or right after the temperature has been turned up. Check that the air filter is clean, that nothing blocks the airflow, and that the outdoor unit is not covered by snow or ice. If it persists in mild weather, call the dealer." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Det kan være helt normalt når det er veldig kaldt ute, eller rett etter at temperaturen er skrudd opp. Sjekk at luftfilteret er rent, at ingenting blokkerer luftstrømmen, og at utedelen ikke er dekket av snø eller is. Vedvarer det i milde perioder, ring forhandleren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This unit does not support automatic fan speed." : {
